    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong>\u3010Nemesis System\u3011</strong><br>\u2022 Each knight has <strong>1 evolving Nemesis</strong> that adapts to your tactics<br>\u2022 Defeat them to uncover <strong>forbidden truths</strong> about the fallen Church</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd2e <strong>\u3010Match-3 Tactics Depth\u3011</strong><br>\u2022 <strong>Chain Combos</strong>: 3-match \u2192 5-match triggers phase shifts<br>\u2022 <strong>Holy Infusion</strong>: Drag to convert rune types</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f <strong>\u3010Meta Progression Web\u3011</strong><br>\u2022 Global level unlocks <strong>new heroes, dungeon layers, black market</strong><br>\u2022 30+ relics <strong>break game rules</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;A <strong>solo odyssey</strong> into darkness.<br>You'll witness\u2014<br>\u2022 The Radiance Knight shatter from purity<br>\u2022 The Blood Oath Knight consumed by vengeance<br>\u2022 The Masked Knight forgetting his own face<br>...Now, it's your turn.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong>\u3010Nemesis System\u3011</strong><br>\u2022 Each knight has <strong>1 evolving Nemesis</strong> that adapts to your tactics<br>\u2022 Defeat them to uncover <strong>forbidden truths</strong> about the fallen Church</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd2e <strong>\u3010Match-3 Tactics Depth\u3011</strong><br>\u2022 <strong>Chain Combos</strong>: 3-match \u2192 5-match triggers phase shifts<br>\u2022 <strong>Holy Infusion</strong>: Drag to convert rune types</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f <strong>\u3010Meta Progression Web\u3011</strong><br>\u2022 Global level unlocks <strong>new heroes, dungeon layers, black market</strong><br>\u2022 30+ relics <strong>break game rules</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;A <strong>solo odyssey</strong> into darkness.<br>You'll witness\u2014<br>\u2022 The Radiance Knight shatter from purity<br>\u2022 The Blood Oath Knight consumed by vengeance<br>\u2022 The Masked Knight forgetting his own face<br>...Now, it's your turn.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
